│                                                                                                       │
│  *   **For Bob (The Carnivore):**                                                                     │
│      *   **Main:** 12oz Grass-Fed Ribeye Steak, pan-seared in clarified butter (no                    │
│  seasonings/plant-based oils).                                                                        │
│      *   **Side:** Grilled bacon strips.                                                              │
│      *   *Note: This meal contains zero plant matter.*                                                │
│                                                                                                       │
│  *   **For Eve (The Vegan):**                                                                         │
│      *   **Main:** Quinoa-stuffed roasted bell pepper with toasted pine nuts, fresh herbs, and a      │
│  lemon-tahini drizzle.                                                                                │
│      *   **Side:** Steamed asparagus with sea salt.                                                   │
│      *   *Note: This meal is 100% plant-based and certified gluten-free.*                             │
│                                                                                                       │
